title: Someday My Prince Will Come
key: Bb
tempo: 150
meter: 3/4
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars in three, ABAC, a chord to a bar. The A leaves the one for
// the three made a dominant with a sharp five, lands on the four, and goes to
// the two by its own five; B walks down from the three through a diminished
// chord to the two-five, twice; C goes to the four by its two-five, climbs
// through a diminished chord back to the one, and turns round.
[A]
| Bbmaj7 | D7#5 | Ebmaj7 | G7b9 |
| Cm7    | G7b9 | Cm7    | F7   |

[B]
| Dm7 | C#dim7 | Cm7 | F7 |
| Dm7 | C#dim7 | Cm7 | F7 |

[A]

[C]
| Fm7    | Bb7 | Ebmaj7 | Edim7 |
| Bbmaj7 | G7  | Cm7    | F7    |
